---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
// The story in five cards that pin and stack as you read (components.css, .stack)
const CHAPTERS = [
  { k: 'The other list', html: 'It isn’t on any app. It lives in the head of the weirdo you met at a dive bar last weekend, the line cook on a smoke break, and that one cousin who somehow always knows a guy who knows a place.' },
  { k: 'The good one', html: 'That list is the good one. The nine-stool noodle counter where you wait on the sidewalk with a menu. The bakery that’s sold out by nine. The bar that was pouring long before anybody thought to review it.' },
  { k: 'Written down', html: 'The Unlisted is that list, written down, for people who’d rather eat well than eat famous. We take our cue from Anthony Bourdain: show up hungry, order what the regulars order, talk to whoever’s behind the counter, and be a good guest.' },
  { k: 'How it’s made', html: 'Search engines and review sites rank what’s already popular. We go the other way. A person picks and checks every place. AI does the legwork: reading what’s been written, drafting the story, and flagging anything we couldn’t confirm. Then a human decides whether it gets in.' },
  { k: 'The rule', html: '<strong>Not everything gets in. That’s the point.</strong>', big: true },
];
---
<Base title="Our story — The Unlisted" description="Every city keeps a second list. This is it, written down." path="/story/">
  <main id="main" class="doc story-page">
    <header class="page-head">
      <p class="kicker mono">Our story</p>
      <h1 class="page-title">Every city keeps a second list</h1>
    </header>
    <ol class="stack story-stack" role="list">
      {CHAPTERS.map((c, i) => (
        <li class="stack-item">
          <article class:list={['chapter', { big: c.big }]}>
            <p class="chapter-k mono"><span>{String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span><span>{c.k}</span></p>
            <p class="chapter-text" set:html={c.html} />
          </article>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>
    <div class="prose story-end">
      <p>We’re open in the Bay Area, San Diego and Portland, with Austin and New York next. Know a door we should knock on? <a href="/suggest/">Tell us</a>.</p>
      <p class="story-maker">The Unlisted is <a href="https://www.icarianforge.com" rel="noopener"><svg class="if-logo" viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M3 21c7-.6 12.5-4.6 16-11"/><path d="M6 25.5c7.8-.6 14-4.8 18-12"/><path d="M11 29.5c6.5-.7 11.6-4.2 15-10"/></g><circle class="sun" cx="25.5" cy="6.5" r="3.8"/></svg>an <span class="ifp"><b>I</b>carian <b>Forge</b></span> product</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
  <script>
    import { initStack } from '../scripts/rails.js';
    requestAnimationFrame(() => setTimeout(() => initStack([...document.querySelectorAll('.story-stack > li')])));
  </script>
</Base>
